---
config:
  theme: default
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: '#ffcc00'
    primaryTextColor: '#003366'
    lineColor: '#008800'
    secondaryColor: '#99ccff'
    tertiaryColor: '#ffe6f0'
    background: '#fff2cc'
description: >-
  baseline/themes/default.mmd, the representative event model, under base-colour overrides in the default theme
  (#1035, D656): the relations and their arrowheads keep v12 default's #333333 under the lineColor
  override (canvasLineColor), as in v12
---
eventmodeling
tf 01 ui Cart.CartScreen
tf 02 cmd Cart.AddItem ->> 01 [[AddItemData]]
tf 03 evt Cart.ItemAdded ->> 02 [[ItemAddedData]]
tf 04 rmo CartItems ->> 03
tf 05 pcr Pricing.Recalculate ->> 04
tf 06 cmd Pricing.ApplyDiscount ->> 05
tf 07 evt Pricing.DiscountApplied
rf 08 ui CheckoutScreen ->> 04
tf 09 rmo Checkout.Summary ->> 07

data AddItemData
{
  productId: 7
}

data ItemAddedData
{
  productId: 7,
  quantity: 1
}
